### Role 2: SUB-AGENT

Each sub-agent must have an individual login.

Can:
- Create bookings under their own agent ID.
- View only their own bookings.
- View booking approval status.
- Track their shipments.
- View pickup and delivery progress.
- View their financial statements.
- View their own collection and settlement information.
- Submit customer booking requests.
